@startuml
!include style.iuml
title AD-10: User Role Management and Sub Admin Promotion or Demotion (WF-22, WF-23)
|Super Admin|
start
:Search and select a user;
if (Action?) then (Promote to Sub Admin)
  :Choose Promote to Sub Admin;
  |System|
  if (User is a registered user?) then (no)
    :Reject request;
    stop
  else (yes)
  endif
  :Ask for confirmation;
  |Super Admin|
  :Confirm;
  |System|
  :Grant Sub Admin privileges;
elseif (Demote Sub Admin) then
  :Choose Demote;
  |System|
  :Ask for confirmation;
  |Super Admin|
  :Confirm;
  |System|
  :Remove Sub Admin privileges immediately;
  :Return user to Student role;
elseif (Activate or deactivate account) then
  |System|
  :Apply status;
  :Reject sessions of deactivated user;
else (Assign or update role)
  |System|
  :Apply role from next authorization check;
endif
:Log actor, target, old and new values and time;
|Super Admin|
:Review role change records;
stop
@enduml
